    <string name="info_body">Spool Maker Android %1$s\n\nThis app reads and writes UltiMaker-compatible NFC spool tags and manages material profiles and remaining amounts.\n\nBefore a tag can be written, the desired material must first be imported from a Cura material file. The app imports the material name, color, GUID and, if available, spool weight. The material is then available in the material library.\n\nProject / source code\nhttps://github.com/joker-mik/SpoolMakerAndroid\n\nNot an official UltiMaker product.</string>
